flowchart TB
    U["User or trusted policy: Goal, constraints, budget and permissions"]
    S["Product Scout: Evidence-backed opportunities and outcomes"]
    L["Worker integration owner: Technical plan, shared contracts and key implementation"]
    C["Verified controller - ordinary code: Dependencies, claims, limits, recovery and backpressure"]
    E1["Worker A: One continuing workstream context"]
    E2["Worker B: Only when independent parallel work is useful"]
    W["Optional temporary subagent: Auxiliary task, no recursive teams"]
    V["Verifier pool: Independent workstream acceptance"]
    I["Integration owner: Pinned combined candidate and project checks"]
    IV["Independent Verifier: Integration Passed for all project ACs"]
    P["Project PR_READY: Not merge or release permission"]
    D["Same Worker continues: authorized delivery and observation"]
    G["CI, protected branches and scoped executors: External enforcement"]

    S -->|"Proposal, not authorization"| U
    U -->|"Goal and bounds"| L
    L -->|"Minimal plan; serial when coupled"| C
    C --> E1
    C --> E2
    E1 -.->|"Bounded assistance"| W
    W -.->|"Evidence and changes"| E1
    E1 -->|"Pinned stream and checks"| V
    E2 -->|"Pinned stream and checks"| V
    V -->|"Findings to original owner; budget applies"| C
    V -->|"INTEGRATION_READY"| I
    I --> IV
    IV -->|"Cross-stream repairs"| L
    IV -->|"Current PASS"| P
    P -->|"PR-only endpoint"| U
    P -->|"Delivery in scope"| D
    U -.->|"Action-specific grants"| D
    D -->|"Observed outcome"| S
    D -->|"Source repair: keep task owner, refresh checks and review"| L
    D -->|"Result or escalation"| U
    G -.->|"Actual check evidence"| V
    G -.->|"Combined checks"| IV
    G -.->|"Enforced actions"| D
